{"id": "1725718", "name": "מציאת בסיס למרחב הפתרונות, עמודות, שורות של מטריצה 3X4", "defaultgrade": 1, "penalty": 0.1, "options": {"multiplicationsign": "dot", "complexno": "i", "matrixparens": "[", "inversetrig": "cos-1", "logicsymbol": "lang", "sqrtsign": true}, "nhints": 0, "functions": [{"name": "random_rrechelon_mmatrix", "params": ["m", "n", "min_val", "max_val", "pivots"], "body": "block([row, A],\n    row:1,\n    A:zeromatrix(m,n),\n    for i thru length(pivots) do(\n        piv: pivots[i],\n        A[row][piv]:1,\n        for j:piv+1 thru n do (\n            A[row][j]:rand_with_prohib(min_val,max_val,[])\n            ),\n        row:row+1\n        ),\n     for i thru length(pivots) do(\n        piv: pivots[i],\n        for j:1 thru i-1 do (\n            A[j][piv]:0\n            )\n        ),\n    A)"}], "questiontext": "<div dir=\"rtl\" style=\"max-width:980px;font-family:Arial;line-height:1.7\"><div style=\"background:#F4F1F5;border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:14px 16px\"><div style=\"font-weight:bold;color:#4b1f6f;margin-bottom:6px\">הנתונים</div><p>נתונה מטריצה <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(3\\times 4\\)</span> ממשית</p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align:center\">\\[A={{CT:0}}\\]</p></div><div style=\"border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:14px 16px;margin:14px 0;overflow-x:auto\"><div style=\"font-weight:bold;color:#4b1f6f;margin-bottom:8px\"><span style=\"display:inline-block;width:26px;height:26px;line-height:26px;text-align:center;border-radius:50%;background:#4b1f6f;color:#fff;margin-left:8px\">א׳</span></div><p>מצאו את הצורה המדורגת קנונית של <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(A\\)</span>. נסמנה ב-<span dir=\"ltr\">\\(A'\\)</span></p><div style=\"background:#FAF9FB;border-radius:8px;padding:10px;direction:ltr;text-align:center;unicode-bidi:isolate\">\\(A'=\\) [[input:ans1]]</div><div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"direction:ltr;text-align:center;unicode-bidi:isolate;margin-top:6px\">[[validation:ans1]]</div><p class=\"input-hint input-hint-grid\" dir=\"rtl\" style=\"font-size:0.88em;color:#555;margin:6px 0 0;text-align:right\">איך מזינים: כל איבר בתיבה משלו: מספר, שבר (למשל <code dir=\"ltr\">1/2</code>) או ביטוי (למשל <code dir=\"ltr\">sqrt(2)</code>).</p></div><p>היעזרו בדירוג שעשיתם לענות על הסעיפים הבאים:</p><div style=\"border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:14px 16px;margin:14px 0;overflow-x:auto\"><div style=\"font-weight:bold;color:#4b1f6f;margin-bottom:8px\"><span style=\"display:inline-block;width:26px;height:26px;line-height:26px;text-align:center;border-radius:50%;background:#4b1f6f;color:#fff;margin-left:8px\">ב׳</span></div><p>נגדיר את <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(W_1\\)</span> להיות תת המרחב של <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(\\mathbb{R}^{{{CT:1}}\\times 1}\\)</span> של כל הפתרונות למערכת ההומוגנית <span dir=\"ltr\">\\( AX=0 \\)</span>. כלומר</p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align:center\">\\[W_1 = \\{v\\; |\\; Av =0\\}\\]</p><p>מצאו בסיס ל-<span dir=\"ltr\">\\(W_1\\)</span>. נסמן את הוקטורים בבסיס ב-<span dir=\"ltr\">\\(v_1,v_2,\\dots \\)</span>. אפשר להזין עד 2 וקטורים. במידה וצריך פחות, השאירו את הוקטורים העודפים כוקטורים של אפסים.</p><div style=\"background:#FAF9FB;border-radius:8px;padding:10px;direction:ltr;text-align:center;unicode-bidi:isolate\">\\(v_1=\\) [[input:ans2]] &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; \\(v_2=\\) [[input:ans3]]</div><div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"direction:ltr;text-align:center;unicode-bidi:isolate;margin-top:6px\">[[validation:ans2]] [[validation:ans3]]</div></div><div style=\"border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:14px 16px;margin:14px 0;overflow-x:auto\"><div style=\"font-weight:bold;color:#4b1f6f;margin-bottom:8px\"><span style=\"display:inline-block;width:26px;height:26px;line-height:26px;text-align:center;border-radius:50%;background:#4b1f6f;color:#fff;margin-left:8px\">ג׳</span></div><p>נגדיר את <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(W_2\\)</span> להיות תת המרחב של <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(\\mathbb{R}^{{{CT:2}}\\times 1}\\)</span> שנפרש על ידי עמודות <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(A\\)</span>. כלומר</p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align:center\">\\[W_2 = \\text{span}\\{C_1^A , \\dots , C_{{{CT:1}}}^A\\}\\]</p><p>מצאו בסיס ל-<span dir=\"ltr\">\\(W_2\\)</span>. נסמן את הוקטורים בבסיס ב-<span dir=\"ltr\">\\(w_1,w_2,\\dots \\)</span>. אפשר להזין עד 4 וקטורים. במידה וצריך פחות, השאירו את הוקטורים העודפים כוקטורים של אפסים.</p><div style=\"background:#FAF9FB;border-radius:8px;padding:10px;direction:ltr;text-align:center;unicode-bidi:isolate\">\\(w_1=\\) [[input:ans5]] &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; \\(w_2=\\) [[input:ans6]]</div><div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"direction:ltr;text-align:center;unicode-bidi:isolate;margin-top:6px\">[[validation:ans5]] [[validation:ans6]]</div><div style=\"margin-top:10px\"></div><div style=\"background:#FAF9FB;border-radius:8px;padding:10px;direction:ltr;text-align:center;unicode-bidi:isolate\">\\(w_3=\\) [[input:ans7]] &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; \\(w_4=\\) [[input:ans8]]</div><div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"direction:ltr;text-align:center;unicode-bidi:isolate;margin-top:6px\">[[validation:ans7]] [[validation:ans8]]</div></div><div style=\"border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:14px 16px;margin:14px 0;overflow-x:auto\"><div style=\"font-weight:bold;color:#4b1f6f;margin-bottom:8px\"><span style=\"display:inline-block;width:26px;height:26px;line-height:26px;text-align:center;border-radius:50%;background:#4b1f6f;color:#fff;margin-left:8px\">ד׳</span></div><p>נגדיר את <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(W_3\\)</span> להיות תת המרחב של <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(\\mathbb{R}^{1\\times {{CT:1}}}\\)</span> שנפרש על ידי שורות <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(A\\)</span>. כלומר</p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align:center\">\\[W_3 = \\text{span}\\{R_1^A ,\\dots , R_{{{CT:2}}}^A\\}\\]</p><p>מצאו בסיס ל-<span dir=\"ltr\">\\(W_3\\)</span>. נסמן את הוקטורים בבסיס ב-<span dir=\"ltr\">\\(u_1,u_2,\\dots \\)</span>. אפשר להזין עד 3 וקטורים. במידה וצריך פחות, השאירו את הוקטורים העודפים כוקטורים של אפסים.</p><div style=\"background:#FAF9FB;border-radius:8px;padding:10px;direction:ltr;text-align:center;unicode-bidi:isolate\">\\(u_1=\\) [[input:ans9]]</div><div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"direction:ltr;text-align:center;unicode-bidi:isolate;margin-top:6px\">[[validation:ans9]]</div><div style=\"margin-top:10px\"></div><div style=\"background:#FAF9FB;border-radius:8px;padding:10px;direction:ltr;text-align:center;unicode-bidi:isolate\">\\(u_2=\\) [[input:ans10]]</div><div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"direction:ltr;text-align:center;unicode-bidi:isolate;margin-top:6px\">[[validation:ans10]]</div><div style=\"margin-top:10px\"></div><div style=\"background:#FAF9FB;border-radius:8px;padding:10px;direction:ltr;text-align:center;unicode-bidi:isolate\">\\(u_3=\\) [[input:ans11]]</div><div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"direction:ltr;text-align:center;unicode-bidi:isolate;margin-top:6px\">[[validation:ans11]]</div></div></div>", "generalfeedback": "", "specificfeedback": "[[feedback:prt1]]<br>[[feedback:prt2]]<br>[[feedback:prt3]]<br>[[feedback:prt4]]<br>", "prtcorrect": "Correct answer, well done.", "prtpartiallycorrect": "Your answer is partially correct.", "prtincorrect": "Incorrect answer.", "inputs": [{"name": "ans1", "type": "matrix", "boxsize": 15, "insertstars": 0, "forbidfloat": true, "forbidwords": "U", "allowwords": "", "mustverify": true, "showvalidation": 1, "syntaxhint": "", "syntaxattribute": 0, "options": ""}, {"name": "ans10", "type": "matrix", "boxsize": 15, "insertstars": 0, "forbidfloat": true, "forbidwords": "", "allowwords": "", "mustverify": true, "showvalidation": 1, "syntaxhint": "matrix([0,0,0,0])", "syntaxattribute": 0, "options": ""}, {"name": "ans11", "type": "matrix", "boxsize": 15, "insertstars": 0, "forbidfloat": true, "forbidwords": "", "allowwords": "", "mustverify": true, "showvalidation": 1, "syntaxhint": "matrix([0,0,0,0])", "syntaxattribute": 0, "options": ""}, {"name": "ans2", "type": "matrix", "boxsize": 15, "insertstars": 0, "forbidfloat": true, "forbidwords": "", "allowwords": "", "mustverify": true, "showvalidation": 1, "syntaxhint": "matrix([0],[0],[0],[0])", "syntaxattribute": 0, "options": ""}, {"name": "ans3", "type": "matrix", "boxsize": 15, "insertstars": 0, "forbidfloat": true, "forbidwords": "", "allowwords": "", "mustverify": true, "showvalidation": 1, "syntaxhint": "matrix([0],[0],[0],[0])", "syntaxattribute": 0, "options": ""}, {"name": "ans5", "type": "matrix", "boxsize": 15, "insertstars": 0, "forbidfloat": true, "forbidwords": "", "allowwords": "", "mustverify": true, "showvalidation": 1, "syntaxhint": "matrix([0],[0],[0])", "syntaxattribute": 0, "options": ""}, {"name": "ans6", "type": "matrix", "boxsize": 15, "insertstars": 0, "forbidfloat": true, "forbidwords": "", "allowwords": "", "mustverify": true, "showvalidation": 1, "syntaxhint": "matrix([0],[0],[0])", "syntaxattribute": 0, "options": ""}, {"name": "ans7", "type": "matrix", "boxsize": 15, "insertstars": 0, "forbidfloat": true, "forbidwords": "", "allowwords": "", "mustverify": true, "showvalidation": 1, "syntaxhint": "matrix([0],[0],[0])", "syntaxattribute": 0, "options": ""}, {"name": "ans8", "type": "matrix", "boxsize": 15, "insertstars": 0, "forbidfloat": true, "forbidwords": "", "allowwords": "", "mustverify": true, "showvalidation": 1, "syntaxhint": "matrix([0],[0],[0])", "syntaxattribute": 0, "options": ""}, {"name": "ans9", "type": "matrix", "boxsize": 15, "insertstars": 0, "forbidfloat": true, "forbidwords": "", "allowwords": "", "mustverify": true, "showvalidation": 1, "syntaxhint": "matrix([0,0,0,0])", "syntaxattribute": 0, "options": ""}], "prts": [{"name": "prt1", "value": 1, "autosimplify": true, "feedbackstyle": 1, "feedbackvariables": "flag1: is(equal(ans1,U));", "firstnode": 0, "nodes": [{"name": 0, "answertest": "AlgEquiv", "sans": "true", "tans": "flag1", "testoptions": null, "quiet": false, "on_true": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 1, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "prt1-1-T", "feedback": "<div dir=\"rtl\"><b>סעיף א׳ — נכון.</b></div>"}, "on_false": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 0, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "prt1-1-F", "feedback": "<div dir=\"rtl\"><b>סעיף א׳ — שגוי.</b></div>"}}]}, {"name": "prt2", "value": 1, "autosimplify": true, "feedbackstyle": 1, "feedbackvariables": "flag2:true;\nM2: addcol(ans2,ans3);\nif not zeromatrixp(U.M2) then flag2:false;\nif rank(M2)#dim_null then flag2:false;\nif length(sublist([ans2,ans3], lambda([v], not zeromatrixp(v)))) # dim_null then flag2:false;", "firstnode": 0, "nodes": [{"name": 0, "answertest": "AlgEquiv", "sans": "true", "tans": "flag2", "testoptions": null, "quiet": false, "on_true": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 1, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "prt2-1-T", "feedback": "<div dir=\"rtl\"><b>סעיף ב׳ — נכון.</b></div>"}, "on_false": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 0, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "prt2-1-F", "feedback": "<div dir=\"rtl\"><b>סעיף ב׳ — שגוי.</b></div>"}}]}, {"name": "prt3", "value": 1, "autosimplify": true, "feedbackstyle": 1, "feedbackvariables": "flag3:true;\nM3: addcol(ans5,ans6,ans7,ans8);\nif rank(addcol(M3,A))#rk then flag3:false;\nif rank(M3)#rk then flag3:false;\nif length(sublist([ans5,ans6,ans7,ans8], lambda([v], not zeromatrixp(v))))#rk then flag3:false;", "firstnode": 0, "nodes": [{"name": 0, "answertest": "AlgEquiv", "sans": "true", "tans": "flag3", "testoptions": null, "quiet": false, "on_true": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 1, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "prt3-1-T", "feedback": "<div dir=\"rtl\"><b>סעיף ג׳ — נכון.</b></div>"}, "on_false": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 0, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "prt3-1-F", "feedback": "<div dir=\"rtl\"><b>סעיף ג׳ — שגוי.</b></div>"}}]}, {"name": "prt4", "value": 1, "autosimplify": true, "feedbackstyle": 1, "feedbackvariables": "flag4:true;\nM4: addrow(ans9,ans10,ans11);\nif rank(addrow(M4,U))#rk then flag4:false;\nif rank(M4)#rk then flag4:false;\nif length(sublist([ans9,ans10,ans11], lambda([v], not zeromatrixp(v))))#rk then flag4:false;", "firstnode": 0, "nodes": [{"name": 0, "answertest": "AlgEquiv", "sans": "true", "tans": "flag4", "testoptions": null, "quiet": false, "on_true": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 1, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "prt4-1-T", "feedback": "<div dir=\"rtl\"><b>סעיף ד׳ — נכון.</b></div>"}, "on_false": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 0, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "prt4-1-F", "feedback": "<div dir=\"rtl\"><b>סעיף ד׳ — שגוי.</b></div>"}}]}], "qvnames": ["A", "E", "U", "colSpaceBae", "dim_null", "m", "matrixEntry", "n", "nullSpaceBase", "piv", "pivots_cols", "rk", "rowSpaceBae"], "nvariants": 50}